OL,3,AMissing fishing boat Kilda recovered
OL,4,Afrom waters off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wreck was spotted east of Orkney on
OL,7,FWednesday morning, and a specialist
OL,8,Fvessel recovered from about 40 miles
OL,9,F(64km) out to sea on Thursday before
OL,10,Fbringing it to Kirkwall.
